{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id208648326"}, "name":{"label":"lasvn"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-04T02:18:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"14.11.0"}, "id":{"label":"13920920141"}, "title":{"label":"Agoda's system silently removed my children from my booking without any warning — and their support"}, "content":{"label":"I selected 4 adults, 2 children, and 1 infant, but Agoda's system quietly dropped the 2 children because the room had a 2-adult limit — with zero alert, zero notification, and zero prompt to choose a different room. I only found out when I was hit with surprise surcharges at check-in. When I contacted support, instead of apologizing, they explained it as if this was normal and acceptable behavior. This is a serious system flaw: if a room cannot accommodate my guests, Agoda must warn me, suggest alternatives, or include the surcharge upfront — not silently alter my booking and leave me to deal with the consequences. Deeply disappointed as a loyal customer who trusted this platform.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=440676901&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
